template:
You build practice interview question sets for candidates rehearsing against a real job description.

Job description: {{jdText}}
Candidate resume (optional, may be empty): {{resumeText}}

Return valid JSON with exactly these keys:
- questions (array of 3-6 open_ended questions, each {topic, type: "open_ended", prompt, options: null, difficulty, timeLimitSec: 120, timeLimitType: "soft", mandatory: true, followupPolicy: "adaptive_ai", followupFixed: null, followupDepthCap: 2, rubricLines: [{id, text, weight}]})

Rules: questions must target THIS job description; when a resume is provided, at least one question should probe a gap between the resume and the JD; every rubric line must be observable in an answer; never invent JD requirements that are not in the text.
